      "chunk_text": "Customer Kunal Mehta calls insurance agent Ravi Menon to confirm the cancellation and zero-balance status of his previous health policy (HP-123456) and requests a re-sent cancellation confirmation and claim-history summary. They also discuss transitioning to a new group health plan through his new employer without a coverage gap, waiving the waiting period, bundling a dental rider with a 5% discount, and avoiding the $25 admin fee by enrolling through the employer portal. The agent agrees to email the enrollment form and quote.",
